(6336335, 938393, 117534, '<td valign="top">Your cats face and background colors are just Purrr-fect.. (sorry had to do that) There is one thing that bothers me about this. His/her tail in the forground is too blurry for me. In my opinion, for what it''s worth, I do not like to see the forground of a picture blurred and leading into a sharper background. Other than that your lighting is excellent, and beautiful focus on his face and eyes!</td>', 'Your cats face and background colors are just Purrr-fect.. (sorry had to do that) There is one thing that bothers me about this. His/her tail in the forground is too blurry for me. In my opinion, for what it''s worth, I do not like to see the forground of a picture blurred and leading into a sharper background. Other than that your lighting is excellent, and beautiful focus on his face and eyes!', '2011-03-01 00:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
