(6336755, 938601, 108069, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of nice photos here but this one has quite a bit extra to it. Very nice exposure control to get the leading lines/motion in the water to draw the viewer in; much more powerful than the mist you typically see with ND filters. Great colors, lovely reflection, excellent composition. This should do quite well. Great stuff.</td>', 'There are a lot of nice photos here but this one has quite a bit extra to it. Very nice exposure control to get the leading lines/motion in the water to draw the viewer in; much more powerful than the mist you typically see with ND filters. Great colors, lovely reflection, excellent composition. This should do quite well. Great stuff.', '2011-03-01 04:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
