(6336760, 937366, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene that would have been truly excellent with a bit more refined processing. There''s quite a bit of noise in the sky that may be the product of HDR. Dang HDR will do that. A slight blur brush would have helped that (quickest, easiest option). The reflection is nice and sharp and so are the lights, etc., so it''s the non-conformaity of the quality of the image in the sky that throws me.<br/> <br/>Not voting, just rambling.</td>', 'Very nice scene that would have been truly excellent with a bit more refined processing. There''s quite a bit of noise in the sky that may be the product of HDR. Dang HDR will do that. A slight blur brush would have helped that (quickest, easiest option). The reflection is nice and sharp and so are the lights, etc., so it''s the non-conformaity of the quality of the image in the sky that throws me. Not voting, just rambling.', '2011-03-01 04:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
