(6337052, 938505, 128166, '<td valign="top">Though it''s a great shot - I like the lighting, the lines, the composition - it''s missing something. I can''t quite say what it is, it''s a good shot don''t get me wrong, it''s just missing <i>something</i> that would make it a great shot.<br/> <br/>It might be emotion, power. When I look at it, I feel like her body is trying to tell two different things. <br/> <br/>I might come back to edit this comment when I know better (how to say) what it''s missing..</td>', 'Though it''s a great shot - I like the lighting, the lines, the composition - it''s missing something. I can''t quite say what it is, it''s a good shot don''t get me wrong, it''s just missing something that would make it a great shot. It might be emotion, power. When I look at it, I feel like her body is trying to tell two different things.  I might come back to edit this comment when I know better (how to say) what it''s missing..', '2011-03-01 10:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
