(6337451, 937720, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image Niall. So many detail to focus on: the eyes, the hand, the cigarillo, the smoke etc. Personally, I really like this composition, especially with the dark negative space to the right of the figure (although I''m sure some will tell you to crop tighter). Only "negative" comment is the face seems to be lacking some detail, especially around the eyes and cheeks. I think maybe part of that is clipping of the blacks?<br/> <br/>Anyway, I think this is a good entry...I suspect it will do 5.8ish?</td>', 'Very interesting image Niall. So many detail to focus on: the eyes, the hand, the cigarillo, the smoke etc. Personally, I really like this composition, especially with the dark negative space to the right of the figure (although I''m sure some will tell you to crop tighter). Only "negative" comment is the face seems to be lacking some detail, especially around the eyes and cheeks. I think maybe part of that is clipping of the blacks? Anyway, I think this is a good entry...I suspect it will do 5.8ish?', '2011-03-01 15:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
