(6337588, 938076, 124982, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, just dont like the expression on her face ... wish there was a smile or some demure look, but it looks too forced (maybe trying to avoid the green beads falling off?).</td>', 'Love the colors, just dont like the expression on her face ... wish there was a smile or some demure look, but it looks too forced (maybe trying to avoid the green beads falling off?).', '2011-03-01 17:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
