(6337673, 938317, 60047, '<td valign="top">I understand where the title is coming from but I don''t get it. Meanwhile, I really like the photo. Nice composition. Nice use of B&amp;W. A bit shallow on the DOF - the nose, front hair and forehead are noticeably blurry but the focus is spot on the eyes.</td>', 'I understand where the title is coming from but I don''t get it. Meanwhile, I really like the photo. Nice composition. Nice use of B&W. A bit shallow on the DOF - the nose, front hair and forehead are noticeably blurry but the focus is spot on the eyes.', '2011-03-01 19:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
