(6339497, 936907, 117474, '<td valign="top">Smells very much like this<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=935973" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1344/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_935973.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1344/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_935973.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1344/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_935973.jpg"/></a> <br/>Excellent capture.</td>', 'Smells very much like this Excellent capture.', '2011-03-02 18:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339500, 936232, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful motion. Smooth tones and colors. Great photo.</td>', 'Wonderful motion. Smooth tones and colors. Great photo.', '2011-03-02 19:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339501, 937731, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very contrasty and I''m searching for the focal point. Could be good but as is it''s a bit harsh.</td>', 'Very contrasty and I''m searching for the focal point. Could be good but as is it''s a bit harsh.', '2011-03-02 19:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339506, 938201, 108069, '<td valign="top">Yes. Excellent wide angle scene with perfect focus near and great depth. Great foreground and lovely colors. Reflections are the icing. Great stuff.</td>', 'Yes. Excellent wide angle scene with perfect focus near and great depth. Great foreground and lovely colors. Reflections are the icing. Great stuff.', '2011-03-02 19:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339510, 938394, 108069, '<td valign="top">It actually gets dizzying. Great perspective. Great composition. Great tones. Very cool photo.</td>', 'It actually gets dizzying. Great perspective. Great composition. Great tones. Very cool photo.', '2011-03-02 19:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339513, 938199, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wow. Hell of a shot. What a scene. Nice composition and nice long exposure to get the movement.</td>', 'Wow. Hell of a shot. What a scene. Nice composition and nice long exposure to get the movement.', '2011-03-02 19:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339515, 937953, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice mood. Great reflections. I would love a bit larger perspective on the environment, but this is well seen. Too blue? Maybe. Good stuff though.</td>', 'Nice mood. Great reflections. I would love a bit larger perspective on the environment, but this is well seen. Too blue? Maybe. Good stuff though.', '2011-03-02 19:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339517, 938552, 108069, '<td valign="top">Where the hell is this? This is downright scary. Where do you go for chicken wings? I live in Germany and I thought that was bad! Great composition and really nice colors and incredible depth.</td>', 'Where the hell is this? This is downright scary. Where do you go for chicken wings? I live in Germany and I thought that was bad! Great composition and really nice colors and incredible depth.', '2011-03-02 19:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339519, 935907, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo. Smooth and soothing. Nice tones and colors and muted hues. Nice stuff.</td>', 'Lovely photo. Smooth and soothing. Nice tones and colors and muted hues. Nice stuff.', '2011-03-02 19:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339521, 935560, 108069, '<td valign="top">Sincere connection. Well lit, quiet and heartfelt scene. Nice.</td>', 'Sincere connection. Well lit, quiet and heartfelt scene. Nice.', '2011-03-02 19:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339524, 937941, 108069, '<td valign="top">Incredible focus. You''ve taken a funny, adorable scene and turned it up 20 notches with your photography skills. Great.</td>', 'Incredible focus. You''ve taken a funny, adorable scene and turned it up 20 notches with your photography skills. Great.', '2011-03-02 19:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339529, 938545, 108069, '<td valign="top">My knowledge of science tells me he didn''t bend time to get there, or cause disturbances in the atmosphere. What''s left is an interestingly constructed photo, and I''ll go with that. Great composition. Wonderful movement everywhere but the key point(s) of your subject. Nice how the bottom right seems to rotate yet the left and top fades out.<br/> <br/>My one complaint would be tonal range. I see black, white, and one version of gray. Maybe on purpose, but I think it''d be improved with a more varied range of tones. And I''d bet this would look awesome in a wide frame, preferably over a bar. Very cool photo.</td>', 'My knowledge of science tells me he didn''t bend time to get there, or cause disturbances in the atmosphere. What''s left is an interestingly constructed photo, and I''ll go with that. Great composition. Wonderful movement everywhere but the key point(s) of your subject. Nice how the bottom right seems to rotate yet the left and top fades out. My one complaint would be tonal range. I see black, white, and one version of gray. Maybe on purpose, but I think it''d be improved with a more varied range of tones. And I''d bet this would look awesome in a wide frame, preferably over a bar. Very cool photo.', '2011-03-02 19:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339530, 937359, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great detail, great lines, professional shot.</td>', 'Great detail, great lines, professional shot.', '2011-03-02 19:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339531, 935447, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. One critique is maybe not so close? I''d love to see some more environment around him. Good composition, though, for this tight crop.</td>', 'Nice capture. One critique is maybe not so close? I''d love to see some more environment around him. Good composition, though, for this tight crop.', '2011-03-02 19:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339533, 938372, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit. Color is slightly off but makes it mysterious. Nice texture.</td>', 'Nicely lit. Color is slightly off but makes it mysterious. Nice texture.', '2011-03-02 19:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339534, 938275, 108069, '<td valign="top">Powerful for the familiar but for an unknowing viewer I might need more context or environment. Nice tones, killer focus into the shadowed hair (not easy) and contemplative scene that is familiar and appreciated. Nice stuff.</td>', 'Powerful for the familiar but for an unknowing viewer I might need more context or environment. Nice tones, killer focus into the shadowed hair (not easy) and contemplative scene that is familiar and appreciated. Nice stuff.', '2011-03-02 19:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339535, 938294, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well spotted scene. The crop feels a bit awkward, possibly too tight... or not tight enough. Either the flow of the water itself or a bit more of the surrounding foliage/scenery/landscape. Nice exposure length, somewhere between the ubiquitous mist of the ND filter and stop motion. Not bad at all.</td>', 'Well spotted scene. The crop feels a bit awkward, possibly too tight... or not tight enough. Either the flow of the water itself or a bit more of the surrounding foliage/scenery/landscape. Nice exposure length, somewhere between the ubiquitous mist of the ND filter and stop motion. Not bad at all.', '2011-03-02 19:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339536, 938216, 108069, '<td valign="top">Truly wonderful image. This looks like a bspurgeon/Ursula hybrid, and I couldn''t give a higher compliment. Sublime tones, a fresh invasion of color, smooth tranquility with a ripple of motion. Great stuff.</td>', 'Truly wonderful image. This looks like a bspurgeon/Ursula hybrid, and I couldn''t give a higher compliment. Sublime tones, a fresh invasion of color, smooth tranquility with a ripple of motion. Great stuff.', '2011-03-02 19:45:04.000000', NULL, 1);
