(6339537, 938507, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice focus. Weird bird. Good composition.</td>', 'Nice focus. Weird bird. Good composition.', '2011-03-02 19:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339539, 938086, 108069, '<td valign="top">Never criticize a potato chip. Let alone six of them. Cool shot, with the contrast between the white underneath and the black above. Nice texture. Munchies!</td>', 'Never criticize a potato chip. Let alone six of them. Cool shot, with the contrast between the white underneath and the black above. Nice texture. Munchies!', '2011-03-02 19:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339542, 938522, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think a bit of editing could have made this stronger. Its a bit dark, I think the snow should have been closer to a true white color. Nice catch though</td>', 'I think a bit of editing could have made this stronger. Its a bit dark, I think the snow should have been closer to a true white color. Nice catch though', '2011-03-02 19:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339548, 938030, 108069, '<td valign="top">I need to sit back to appreciate this and I do. I really do. Great focus, great presence. Nice stuff.</td>', 'I need to sit back to appreciate this and I do. I really do. Great focus, great presence. Nice stuff.', '2011-03-02 19:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339555, 938474, 108069, '<td valign="top">Incredible scene. I maybe would have preferred a horizontal crop to really make use of the color in the hills and the clouds but I''ve never taken this cool a photo so what do I know. Awesome.</td>', 'Incredible scene. I maybe would have preferred a horizontal crop to really make use of the color in the hills and the clouds but I''ve never taken this cool a photo so what do I know. Awesome.', '2011-03-02 20:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339556, 938557, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and focus. Great shot.</td>', 'Nice composition and focus. Great shot.', '2011-03-02 20:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339557, 937849, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice focus. Nice depth in the eyes.</td>', 'Nice focus. Nice depth in the eyes.', '2011-03-02 20:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339558, 938226, 91783, '<td valign="top">wow very cool find!</td>', 'wow very cool find!', '2011-03-02 20:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339560, 937542, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. Wonderful depth and colors and excellent exposure management. Polarizer? I cannot do this, damn it. Great stuff.</td>', 'Lovely shot. Wonderful depth and colors and excellent exposure management. Polarizer? I cannot do this, damn it. Great stuff.', '2011-03-02 20:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339563, 938519, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait. Great lighting and nice, clean processing.</td>', 'Very nice portrait. Great lighting and nice, clean processing.', '2011-03-02 20:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339564, 936768, 108069, '<td valign="top">This looks like some LVicari awesomeness. Processing is beyond compare. Outstanding image.</td>', 'This looks like some LVicari awesomeness. Processing is beyond compare. Outstanding image.', '2011-03-02 20:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339575, 936988, 108069, '<td valign="top">Fabulous focus, color and detail. Nice backdrop to present it all. Great photo.</td>', 'Fabulous focus, color and detail. Nice backdrop to present it all. Great photo.', '2011-03-02 20:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339577, 936180, 91783, '<td valign="top">your going to get dinged for the text.</td>', 'your going to get dinged for the text.', '2011-03-02 20:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339583, 936947, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice scene but as you''ve heard it needs to be a bit sharper, less noisy, and more contrasty. Nice composition and highly promising as a photo, but needs a better finish in processing.</td>', 'Nice scene but as you''ve heard it needs to be a bit sharper, less noisy, and more contrasty. Nice composition and highly promising as a photo, but needs a better finish in processing.', '2011-03-02 20:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339584, 938063, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great focus on that eye. Nice shallow DoF. Very nice seagull portrait.</td>', 'Great focus on that eye. Nice shallow DoF. Very nice seagull portrait.', '2011-03-02 20:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339585, 938317, 91783, '<td valign="top">what is up with those side-burn things?!  good photo. lighting is really good.</td>', 'what is up with those side-burn things?!  good photo. lighting is really good.', '2011-03-02 20:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339586, 938570, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Nice detail. Cool photo.</td>', 'Great colors. Nice detail. Cool photo.', '2011-03-02 20:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339594, 938588, 108069, '<td valign="top">Tough capture. Focus is nice for all you likely had to deal with. Bit of a tight crop for me, but nice work.</td>', 'Tough capture. Focus is nice for all you likely had to deal with. Bit of a tight crop for me, but nice work.', '2011-03-02 20:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339603, 938505, 128002, '<td valign="top">This is amazing, Sofia.  I love the lighting, your facial expression, and body language. 9</td>', 'This is amazing, Sofia.  I love the lighting, your facial expression, and body language. 9', '2011-03-02 20:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339612, 937839, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene, but... something seems off. The lighting, mostly. The sand does not seem to be in the same world as the rock it surrounds. Nor does the sea. And the lighting doesn''t seem congruent between the sky and the rocks, or sea, or sand. Bring this image back to zero and you''ve got some wonderful stuff, but as it is it seems tweaked.<br/> <br/>Not voting, just spouting unknowledge.</td>', 'Very nice scene, but... something seems off. The lighting, mostly. The sand does not seem to be in the same world as the rock it surrounds. Nor does the sea. And the lighting doesn''t seem congruent between the sky and the rocks, or sea, or sand. Bring this image back to zero and you''ve got some wonderful stuff, but as it is it seems tweaked. Not voting, just spouting unknowledge.', '2011-03-02 20:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339617, 938459, 127608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! (9)</td>', 'Beautiful! (9)', '2011-03-02 20:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
