(6340900, 938501, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo. Great focal depth, sharp where it needs it. High-keyish treatment really tractor-beams your eyes to hers with the great contrast it reveals. Model is stunning, connects with the camera and comes across sincere. Excellent composition. Outstanding portrait.<br/> <br/>Edit: I''m back to say, however, that I don''t agree with the title, as she looks to be on a picnic table or rough floor that has no relation to a bedroom. No big deal, but I had to criticize <i>something</i>.</td>', 'Wonderful photo. Great focal depth, sharp where it needs it. High-keyish treatment really tractor-beams your eyes to hers with the great contrast it reveals. Model is stunning, connects with the camera and comes across sincere. Excellent composition. Outstanding portrait. Edit: I''m back to say, however, that I don''t agree with the title, as she looks to be on a picnic table or rough floor that has no relation to a bedroom. No big deal, but I had to criticize something.', '2011-03-04 06:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340901, 938193, 108069, '<td valign="top">Cute scene. The background is a bit distracting, but it''s sharp and well exposed and cute.</td>', 'Cute scene. The background is a bit distracting, but it''s sharp and well exposed and cute.', '2011-03-04 06:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340908, 938559, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well spotted and nice capture. Great composition. I will complain about the sharpening, though. Mr. Bird seems plopped there like clip art. I''d rather he be soft and naturally blend into his environment than look slightly unnatural. Well done, but a different finishing approach would have resulted in a more natural photo that <i>may</i> have been appreciated more. But what do I know. I''m not voting and I don''t <i>really</i> know how others will see this.</td>', 'Well spotted and nice capture. Great composition. I will complain about the sharpening, though. Mr. Bird seems plopped there like clip art. I''d rather he be soft and naturally blend into his environment than look slightly unnatural. Well done, but a different finishing approach would have resulted in a more natural photo that may have been appreciated more. But what do I know. I''m not voting and I don''t really know how others will see this.', '2011-03-04 06:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340929, 938516, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. I love the natural light. Adds texture and character and depth. Very well done.</td>', 'Great portrait. I love the natural light. Adds texture and character and depth. Very well done.', '2011-03-04 07:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340930, 936211, 108069, '<td valign="top">Holy smokes these are some colors. So rich and vibrant. Nice composition. I like how the jet trail reflections appear and disappear from teh ice to the thawed section. Awesome photo.</td>', 'Holy smokes these are some colors. So rich and vibrant. Nice composition. I like how the jet trail reflections appear and disappear from teh ice to the thawed section. Awesome photo.', '2011-03-04 07:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340932, 938326, 108069, '<td valign="top">Masterful macro. Perfect focus (I will be checking aperture stats on this one so I can learn). Super sharp, crystal clear, and awesome processing to keep it 100% natural. Outstanding. Roz is the only one I know who can do it this well so I''m either right or it''s the highest compliment.</td>', 'Masterful macro. Perfect focus (I will be checking aperture stats on this one so I can learn). Super sharp, crystal clear, and awesome processing to keep it 100% natural. Outstanding. Roz is the only one I know who can do it this well so I''m either right or it''s the highest compliment.', '2011-03-04 07:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340934, 938526, 108069, '<td valign="top">Awesome title. Beautiful photo. Hazy gray day reflections of peace. Great stuff.</td>', 'Awesome title. Beautiful photo. Hazy gray day reflections of peace. Great stuff.', '2011-03-04 07:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340938, 938613, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice environmental scene. Great composition.</td>', 'Nice environmental scene. Great composition.', '2011-03-04 07:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
