(6340940, 938602, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful story. Nice tones. Dreamy.</td>', 'Wonderful story. Nice tones. Dreamy.', '2011-03-04 07:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340948, 938505, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Wonderfully lit. Well composed to get this light and the model to work together as a story. Great tones. Backdrop has some nice texture to it. Very well done.</td>', 'Very nice. Wonderfully lit. Well composed to get this light and the model to work together as a story. Great tones. Backdrop has some nice texture to it. Very well done.', '2011-03-04 07:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340950, 937760, 108069, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! So well spotted. Superb composition. The play of modern-building reflected light off this older structure is really a nice theme. So random yet so evenly distributed. A patchwork of urban exposure. Awesome stuff.<br/> <br/>Back to add it as a favorite. I love this photo.</td>', 'Fantastic! So well spotted. Superb composition. The play of modern-building reflected light off this older structure is really a nice theme. So random yet so evenly distributed. A patchwork of urban exposure. Awesome stuff. Back to add it as a favorite. I love this photo.', '2011-03-04 07:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340951, 937964, 108069, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition. Great motion, lively and authentic colors, super scene. Excellent photo.</td>', 'Awesome composition. Great motion, lively and authentic colors, super scene. Excellent photo.', '2011-03-04 07:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340962, 938375, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice title. Very interesting scene and nice composition. Processing seems slightly posterized, which works for this. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice title. Very interesting scene and nice composition. Processing seems slightly posterized, which works for this. Nice job.', '2011-03-04 07:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340963, 938278, 108069, '<td valign="top">Fantastic tones. The range is really well represented in every area of the photo. Very nicely composed. Wonderful texture. Egret? They''re always good, especially when understated yet a highlight once found. Excellent processing. Title couldn''t be better.<br/> <br/>Criticisms? There''s a speck of dust at about 11 o''clock. I doubt anyone cares about that, though. (But before you sell any prints...)</td>', 'Fantastic tones. The range is really well represented in every area of the photo. Very nicely composed. Wonderful texture. Egret? They''re always good, especially when understated yet a highlight once found. Excellent processing. Title couldn''t be better. Criticisms? There''s a speck of dust at about 11 o''clock. I doubt anyone cares about that, though. (But before you sell any prints...)', '2011-03-04 07:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340966, 937450, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great tones. Mysterious texture and compelling image made by this handling and treatment. An extension from reality to the otherworld, a glimpse of what nature does when no one''s looking, of how twisted life can be under that special spotlight. Great stuff.</td>', 'Great tones. Mysterious texture and compelling image made by this handling and treatment. An extension from reality to the otherworld, a glimpse of what nature does when no one''s looking, of how twisted life can be under that special spotlight. Great stuff.', '2011-03-04 08:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341011, 933784, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: An image that rewards exploration - there are a whole bunch of things to look at: the neon with the foliage overhang; the peeling paint of the door frame and the red sign;the couple and how she is looking out, but not at you; the ambiguous reflection; and the interesting floor surfaces. All of these things are perhaps in and of themselves inconsequential but together they reminds that sometimes it''s good to pause, take a breath and look around.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not much at all really, I think the image is quite straight-up and perhaps this limits its ''crafted'' feel, but this is just the flip side of what appeals about it.<br/> <br/>Overall: A nice observational piece.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: An image that rewards exploration - there are a whole bunch of things to look at: the neon with the foliage overhang; the peeling paint of the door frame and the red sign;the couple and how she is looking out, but not at you; the ambiguous reflection; and the interesting floor surfaces. All of these things are perhaps in and of themselves inconsequential but together they reminds that sometimes it''s good to pause, take a breath and look around. Critical stuff: Not much at all really, I think the image is quite straight-up and perhaps this limits its ''crafted'' feel, but this is just the flip side of what appeals about it. Overall: A nice observational piece.', '2011-03-04 10:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341021, 938326, 106109, '<td valign="top">Such a cool shot!</td>', 'Such a cool shot!', '2011-03-04 10:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
