(6341029, 936283, 106109, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured.</td>', 'Nicely captured.', '2011-03-04 11:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341037, 938216, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This is beautiful. Effective, not least because of its ambiguity - essence of ocean, beach, sky and car lights but not enough information for us to be sure. The choices you''ve made with saturation and tone are wonderful.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not much at all... perhaps the slight darkening of the right side is a little prominent given the smoothness of the rest of the image.<br/> <br/>Overall: A very nice abstract indeed.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This is beautiful. Effective, not least because of its ambiguity - essence of ocean, beach, sky and car lights but not enough information for us to be sure. The choices you''ve made with saturation and tone are wonderful. Critical stuff: Not much at all... perhaps the slight darkening of the right side is a little prominent given the smoothness of the rest of the image. Overall: A very nice abstract indeed.', '2011-03-04 11:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341044, 937343, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Easy to get distracted by the thoroughly entertaining inflatable but there is much more going on here than just an inflatable doll in a pool. The splash around the leg is so well captured, like the foot has just entered the water, yet we see it - firmly in place - on the step. We expect a male figure but that looks like a dress, the legs are smooth and the nails are painted. We look for more clues in the reflection but our view is obscured by our pneumatic friend. We think we can see a face, but to me this has a strange plastic-like quality to it, like someone wearing a mask of a dead president reminiscent of many a Hollywood heist production. Then there is the other reflection, is that a tower of some sort? The thought changes the context from a back yard pool to something entirely more public.... intrigue upon intrigue.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Far too interesting to mention anything here.<br/> <br/>Overall: Highly engaging, I feel like I''m watching a good movie.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Easy to get distracted by the thoroughly entertaining inflatable but there is much more going on here than just an inflatable doll in a pool. The splash around the leg is so well captured, like the foot has just entered the water, yet we see it - firmly in place - on the step. We expect a male figure but that looks like a dress, the legs are smooth and the nails are painted. We look for more clues in the reflection but our view is obscured by our pneumatic friend. We think we can see a face, but to me this has a strange plastic-like quality to it, like someone wearing a mask of a dead president reminiscent of many a Hollywood heist production. Then there is the other reflection, is that a tower of some sort? The thought changes the context from a back yard pool to something entirely more public.... intrigue upon intrigue. Critical stuff: Far too interesting to mention anything here. Overall: Highly engaging, I feel like I''m watching a good movie.', '2011-03-04 11:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341050, 937760, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Beautiful, distortion-free, well-toned image with extraordinary light. This is one of those images that are more than the sum of their parts. I like how each of the windows offers something similar but with variety - like a box of chocolates. Where does that pattern of light come from? Reflected sunlight from a building behind the camera lens?<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing really<br/> <br/>Overall: This has great appeal, it would make an excellent wall poster.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Beautiful, distortion-free, well-toned image with extraordinary light. This is one of those images that are more than the sum of their parts. I like how each of the windows offers something similar but with variety - like a box of chocolates. Where does that pattern of light come from? Reflected sunlight from a building behind the camera lens? Critical stuff: Nothing really Overall: This has great appeal, it would make an excellent wall poster.', '2011-03-04 11:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341068, 938356, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: What a great sky (especially that cloud just above the sea on the left) and the moving figures are marvellous too. I really like the highlights on the sea beyond the figures.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I do like the vignette but I think it could be a tad darker, also this is one of those images that I think would look even better with a little added grain.<br/> <br/>Overall: Lovely stuff. Well made.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: What a great sky (especially that cloud just above the sea on the left) and the moving figures are marvellous too. I really like the highlights on the sea beyond the figures. Critical stuff: I do like the vignette but I think it could be a tad darker, also this is one of those images that I think would look even better with a little added grain. Overall: Lovely stuff. Well made.', '2011-03-04 12:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341069, 937504, 118154, '<td valign="top">A little too soft in my opinion.</td>', 'A little too soft in my opinion.', '2011-03-04 12:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341133, 938513, 113419, '<td valign="top">She''s beautiful.  Love her intense gaze into the camera.  Her pose is perfect, it shows off her body and the hand by her face causes you to get caught in her eyes.  Normally I''m not a fan of facial piercings but she wears them beautifully.  Even the nipple piercings are nice.  The lighting you used falls perfectly on her.  You did a marvelous job capturing all of her beauty.</td>', 'She''s beautiful.  Love her intense gaze into the camera.  Her pose is perfect, it shows off her body and the hand by her face causes you to get caught in her eyes.  Normally I''m not a fan of facial piercings but she wears them beautifully.  Even the nipple piercings are nice.  The lighting you used falls perfectly on her.  You did a marvelous job capturing all of her beauty.', '2011-03-04 13:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341290, 938458, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives:This is a flat out wonderful portrait, I like the honesty of it. The light and composition are perfect, as is the depth of field. I really like the cool muted coloration, it matches the overall image very nicely indeed.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing<br/> <br/>Overall: Perfectly judged in every respect.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives:This is a flat out wonderful portrait, I like the honesty of it. The light and composition are perfect, as is the depth of field. I really like the cool muted coloration, it matches the overall image very nicely indeed. Critical stuff: Nothing Overall: Perfectly judged in every respect.', '2011-03-04 16:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341292, 938577, 60698, '<td valign="top">So sentimental and lovely! To still be in love and holding hands after all those years. This image is a beautiful and real depiction of eternal love. They stand out so nicely against the green and the winding path adds another pretty element to the photo. Lighting is fabulous!</td>', 'So sentimental and lovely! To still be in love and holding hands after all those years. This image is a beautiful and real depiction of eternal love. They stand out so nicely against the green and the winding path adds another pretty element to the photo. Lighting is fabulous!', '2011-03-04 16:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341297, 938509, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the tilt is adding here. Makes her look overly large and overshadows any mood or atmosphere.</td>', 'Not sure what the tilt is adding here. Makes her look overly large and overshadows any mood or atmosphere.', '2011-03-04 16:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341298, 938226, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great subject -- maybe a bit too much in the shadows.</td>', 'Great subject -- maybe a bit too much in the shadows.', '2011-03-04 16:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341299, 935509, 76335, '<td valign="top">I didn''t need the toothache-inducing title -- but it''s a beautiful shot.</td>', 'I didn''t need the toothache-inducing title -- but it''s a beautiful shot.', '2011-03-04 16:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341300, 936627, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great shadowy rhythm.</td>', 'Great shadowy rhythm.', '2011-03-04 16:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341301, 938401, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but the water looks plastic for some reason (noise reduction?).</td>', 'Nice scene, but the water looks plastic for some reason (noise reduction?).', '2011-03-04 16:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341303, 937450, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Looks like someone got their Silver Efex Pro 2! I find this image to be thoroughly disorientating, that''s a good thing - I like images that confound. The textures are obviously very well developed and I suspect this has turned out just as you wanted.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Although I admire the image, I don''t like it - I tend to dislike crunchy looking foliage and is uber-ccrunchy!<br/> <br/>Overall: Nicely made but not for me.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Looks like someone got their Silver Efex Pro 2! I find this image to be thoroughly disorientating, that''s a good thing - I like images that confound. The textures are obviously very well developed and I suspect this has turned out just as you wanted. Critical stuff: Although I admire the image, I don''t like it - I tend to dislike crunchy looking foliage and is uber-ccrunchy! Overall: Nicely made but not for me.', '2011-03-04 16:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341305, 938064, 76335, '<td valign="top">Discoplanetary goodness.</td>', 'Discoplanetary goodness.', '2011-03-04 16:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341306, 937552, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully funky composition.</td>', 'Wonderfully funky composition.', '2011-03-04 16:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341309, 937611, 76335, '<td valign="top">Bloody rich.</td>', 'Bloody rich.', '2011-03-04 16:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341312, 936440, 76335, '<td valign="top">Here''s a novel approach to selective desaturation.</td>', 'Here''s a novel approach to selective desaturation.', '2011-03-04 16:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341313, 938602, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Powerful. Perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful. Powerful. Perfect.', '2011-03-04 16:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341314, 938519, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and pose, but the textures and fine detail seem compromised somehow.</td>', 'Good lighting and pose, but the textures and fine detail seem compromised somehow.', '2011-03-04 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341316, 937837, 76335, '<td valign="top">Louisiana? I lived there as a kid. (Unless it''s somewhere else.) In any case, a fine black and white landscape.</td>', 'Louisiana? I lived there as a kid. (Unless it''s somewhere else.) In any case, a fine black and white landscape.', '2011-03-04 16:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341317, 938418, 76335, '<td valign="top">Handprints everywhere! A wonderful photograph with a great story, I''m sure.</td>', 'Handprints everywhere! A wonderful photograph with a great story, I''m sure.', '2011-03-04 17:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341319, 938526, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice impressionism and beautiful tones here.</td>', 'Nice impressionism and beautiful tones here.', '2011-03-04 17:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341324, 933410, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Oh wow! This is just off-the-scale good. Where to begin....? The scratchy textural effect you''ve managed to produce is so, so compelling - it almost adds an etched 3d effect. The figure looms large and almost scarecrow-like with hands of straw. The flag and gravestones(?) give this an additional poignancy.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing<br/> <br/>Overall: Astonishing work.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Oh wow! This is just off-the-scale good. Where to begin....? The scratchy textural effect you''ve managed to produce is so, so compelling - it almost adds an etched 3d effect. The figure looms large and almost scarecrow-like with hands of straw. The flag and gravestones(?) give this an additional poignancy. Critical stuff: Nothing Overall: Astonishing work.', '2011-03-04 17:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341332, 938363, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Your crop means that this is a wonderfully naturally framed (and nested) image. Great stark red coloration, contrasting with the yellow signs. The figure too is very interesting with his hand placed awkwardly over his face.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I normally don''t mind selective desaturation but I think it looks a bit gimicky here.<br/> <br/>Overall: Highly interesting image, beautifully framed but for me not optimally edited.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Your crop means that this is a wonderfully naturally framed (and nested) image. Great stark red coloration, contrasting with the yellow signs. The figure too is very interesting with his hand placed awkwardly over his face. Critical stuff: I normally don''t mind selective desaturation but I think it looks a bit gimicky here. Overall: Highly interesting image, beautifully framed but for me not optimally edited.', '2011-03-04 17:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341371, 938348, 23484, '<td valign="top">The first time I''ve seen a picture of this from your perspective. Nice.</td>', 'The first time I''ve seen a picture of this from your perspective. Nice.', '2011-03-04 18:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341372, 936604, 23484, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective and nice lighting.</td>', 'Cool perspective and nice lighting.', '2011-03-04 18:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341373, 937857, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and nice angles.</td>', 'Nice shot and nice angles.', '2011-03-04 18:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341377, 936604, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great image. Believe it or not the lint on the hat adds to the scene, as it helps identify the hat. Nice composition as well.</td>', 'Great image. Believe it or not the lint on the hat adds to the scene, as it helps identify the hat. Nice composition as well.', '2011-03-04 18:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6341378, 935904, 108069, '<td valign="top">East of Omaha? Cool photo. Story, lines, tones, interesting composition. Nice.</td>', 'East of Omaha? Cool photo. Story, lines, tones, interesting composition. Nice.', '2011-03-04 18:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
