(6342376, 938513, 94241, '<td valign="top">I feel there''s a disconnect between her face and her body.  Her face is made up, calm, and has shaping shadows.  Her body is distended, lit flat, and a little overexposed.</td>', 'I feel there''s a disconnect between her face and her body.  Her face is made up, calm, and has shaping shadows.  Her body is distended, lit flat, and a little overexposed.', '2011-03-05 21:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
