(6342810, 936213, 101702, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot of the boy but the editing is terrible. Looks like there is a big smudge over his left ear where you have gone over the hair, and there is a whole lot of visible editing artifacts above his left shoulder. Maybe you need to increase the brightness on your screen to see it, but it''s very visible on my monitor and ruins the otherwise great shot.</td>', 'Nice candid shot of the boy but the editing is terrible. Looks like there is a big smudge over his left ear where you have gone over the hair, and there is a whole lot of visible editing artifacts above his left shoulder. Maybe you need to increase the brightness on your screen to see it, but it''s very visible on my monitor and ruins the otherwise great shot.', '2011-03-06 14:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
