(6342899, 936986, 94241, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous skyline.  :)<br/> <br/>I feel the foreground isn''t adding anything though.  The posed, crisp foreground just takes attention away from the sweeping, glowing skyline.  Maybe just a wider aspect ratio on the crop that emphasizes the foreground less might work.  A wider aspect ratio would also feel more cinema-like.</td>', 'Gorgeous skyline.  :) I feel the foreground isn''t adding anything though.  The posed, crisp foreground just takes attention away from the sweeping, glowing skyline.  Maybe just a wider aspect ratio on the crop that emphasizes the foreground less might work.  A wider aspect ratio would also feel more cinema-like.', '2011-03-06 16:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342912, 936777, 101702, '<td valign="top">Great vibrancy on the colours at the prow of the boat and I love the tones in the water - reminiscent of JulietNN''s winner in the best of 2010 challenge. If I was being a tiny bit picky I''d clone out the two small boats on the right hand edge of the frame as they are minorly disctracting, but other than that a great shot and the clouds frame the rock nicely.</td>', 'Great vibrancy on the colours at the prow of the boat and I love the tones in the water - reminiscent of JulietNN''s winner in the best of 2010 challenge. If I was being a tiny bit picky I''d clone out the two small boats on the right hand edge of the frame as they are minorly disctracting, but other than that a great shot and the clouds frame the rock nicely.', '2011-03-06 17:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342919, 936753, 101702, '<td valign="top">There are always a hatful of beach/sun shots in the free studies - almost to the point of cliché. That said, this is by far and away the best I have seen for some time. Great leading lines, beautifully exposed, and the motion generated by the wind is sublime. I would like to see this on the front page.</td>', 'There are always a hatful of beach/sun shots in the free studies - almost to the point of cliché. That said, this is by far and away the best I have seen for some time. Great leading lines, beautifully exposed, and the motion generated by the wind is sublime. I would like to see this on the front page.', '2011-03-06 17:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342921, 938415, 101702, '<td valign="top">Nice to see something different to all the sunsets and portraits that always adorn the free studies. If I was being a tiny bit picky I would have taken 10 minutes to clone out the leaves at the top right to neaten up the image (perfectly allowed in advanced editing).</td>', 'Nice to see something different to all the sunsets and portraits that always adorn the free studies. If I was being a tiny bit picky I would have taken 10 minutes to clone out the leaves at the top right to neaten up the image (perfectly allowed in advanced editing).', '2011-03-06 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342924, 937977, 101702, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines and tones. Nicely balanced between ground and sky too. Not sure it needed the border really.</td>', 'Great leading lines and tones. Nicely balanced between ground and sky too. Not sure it needed the border really.', '2011-03-06 17:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342938, 938076, 94241, '<td valign="top">Brilliant makeup.  :)<br/> <br/>I wish there was a touch more sharpness to her lips.</td>', 'Brilliant makeup.  :) I wish there was a touch more sharpness to her lips.', '2011-03-06 17:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342939, 938372, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting across her face.  :)<br/> <br/>The shape of the catch-light in her left eye is a little bit unnerving.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting across her face.  :) The shape of the catch-light in her left eye is a little bit unnerving.', '2011-03-06 17:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342948, 938308, 94241, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, but I think it needs some adjustments in post to really bring it out.  Looking at the tones of this image it''s kind of dark on top, bright in the middle, and medium down at the bottom.  I think a couple gradiated brightness adjustments could do some magic.  I personally would brighten the sky, darken the bottom and probably turn the contrast up a lot around the road, and really really darken the grassy part on the left.  I think that would open up the feel of the image.</td>', 'I love this shot, but I think it needs some adjustments in post to really bring it out.  Looking at the tones of this image it''s kind of dark on top, bright in the middle, and medium down at the bottom.  I think a couple gradiated brightness adjustments could do some magic.  I personally would brighten the sky, darken the bottom and probably turn the contrast up a lot around the road, and really really darken the grassy part on the left.  I think that would open up the feel of the image.', '2011-03-06 18:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342956, 938607, 94241, '<td valign="top">I feel the subjects are sort of dwarfed by the trees.  The trees are denser, more intricate, and so much visually larger, it''s almost like they are the subject.  It''s a beautiful shot, I guess I''m just saying I think the story I get from it may not be the story you intend.</td>', 'I feel the subjects are sort of dwarfed by the trees.  The trees are denser, more intricate, and so much visually larger, it''s almost like they are the subject.  It''s a beautiful shot, I guess I''m just saying I think the story I get from it may not be the story you intend.', '2011-03-06 18:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342960, 938469, 94241, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky!<br/> <br/>I suggest shaving just a little bit off the bottom in crop.  (a) I think a wider aspect ratio to the crop would give a more cinema feel.  (b) the brightness of the frost is competing for the brightness of the sky for attention.  I think cutting off some of the frosty parts would help bring the viewer''s attention back to the main subject.</td>', 'Gorgeous sky! I suggest shaving just a little bit off the bottom in crop.  (a) I think a wider aspect ratio to the crop would give a more cinema feel.  (b) the brightness of the frost is competing for the brightness of the sky for attention.  I think cutting off some of the frosty parts would help bring the viewer''s attention back to the main subject.', '2011-03-06 18:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342961, 938473, 94241, '<td valign="top">Very wide angle lens?  Linear perspective seems really distorted.</td>', 'Very wide angle lens?  Linear perspective seems really distorted.', '2011-03-06 18:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342964, 936604, 94241, '<td valign="top">Very very cool.<br/> <br/>There''s little bits of dust and such that are grabbing attention.  I''d highly urge a few minutes be spent with the healing brush in photoshop.  :)</td>', 'Very very cool. There''s little bits of dust and such that are grabbing attention.  I''d highly urge a few minutes be spent with the healing brush in photoshop.  :)', '2011-03-06 18:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342965, 938191, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and setup.<br/> <br/>Uh, not sure if wine is common with burgers where you live.  Here it would be a microbrew beer.  :)</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and setup. Uh, not sure if wine is common with burgers where you live.  Here it would be a microbrew beer.  :)', '2011-03-06 18:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342966, 935702, 94241, '<td valign="top">Fan-friggen-tastic.  :)<br/> <br/>I feel it''s a little too bright.  Not everywhere, I think there needs to be vignette or some gradient brightness adjustments to kind of lead the eye through the image.  Right now it''s all more or less evenly bright across the frame.<br/> <br/>Also, maybe just a touch of blur on the highlights would add to the dreamy other-world feel.</td>', 'Fan-friggen-tastic.  :) I feel it''s a little too bright.  Not everywhere, I think there needs to be vignette or some gradient brightness adjustments to kind of lead the eye through the image.  Right now it''s all more or less evenly bright across the frame. Also, maybe just a touch of blur on the highlights would add to the dreamy other-world feel.', '2011-03-06 18:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342971, 935856, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Such a perfect shot.<br/> <br/>I would suggest adding a little more saturation, maybe even play with duotones.  Were it me, I''d duotone the highlights a little warmer and the shadows a little cooler.  Maybe brush in a little more brightness on the front of his muzzle and right side of his face, around that eye.  The left eye also maybe just a touch more light.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Such a perfect shot. I would suggest adding a little more saturation, maybe even play with duotones.  Were it me, I''d duotone the highlights a little warmer and the shadows a little cooler.  Maybe brush in a little more brightness on the front of his muzzle and right side of his face, around that eye.  The left eye also maybe just a touch more light.', '2011-03-06 18:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6342976, 936753, 94241, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Just wow.  Absolutely phenomenal control of light, shadow, reflection, and motion.<br/> <br/>If I had one suggestion, I feel I wish it had a wider aspect ratio on the crop.  It feels a little confined.</td>', 'Wow.  Just wow.  Absolutely phenomenal control of light, shadow, reflection, and motion. If I had one suggestion, I feel I wish it had a wider aspect ratio on the crop.  It feels a little confined.', '2011-03-06 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
