(6343904, 938058, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. Great texture in the grass, depth to the clouds and sky, great colors throughout. Wonderful detail specifically in the clouds. Excellent composition. Swans for extra credit. Nice.<br/> <br/>Only complaint would be that it looks a tad oversharpened, but my monitor where I''m currently at sucks and I''m not voting anyway, so don''t worry about my view on that. The rest is spot on, and obvious from any monitor.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. Great texture in the grass, depth to the clouds and sky, great colors throughout. Wonderful detail specifically in the clouds. Excellent composition. Swans for extra credit. Nice. Only complaint would be that it looks a tad oversharpened, but my monitor where I''m currently at sucks and I''m not voting anyway, so don''t worry about my view on that. The rest is spot on, and obvious from any monitor.', '2011-03-07 10:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343907, 938458, 108069, '<td valign="top">Haunting portrait. Powerful. Processing is superb. I''ll be back to hopefully get some tips on how you did this.</td>', 'Haunting portrait. Powerful. Processing is superb. I''ll be back to hopefully get some tips on how you did this.', '2011-03-07 10:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
