(6343911, 933410, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice depth, as if the stones are steps, enhanced by the streaks toward them. Not often do you see a shot like this with an American flag (at least in my opinion), so that''s an interesting twist. I really like the anonymity in the shot. Great image.</td>', 'Nice depth, as if the stones are steps, enhanced by the streaks toward them. Not often do you see a shot like this with an American flag (at least in my opinion), so that''s an interesting twist. I really like the anonymity in the shot. Great image.', '2011-03-07 10:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343912, 938196, 108069, '<td valign="top">Adorable photo. Nice contrast, well composed.</td>', 'Adorable photo. Nice contrast, well composed.', '2011-03-07 10:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343913, 938517, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Excellent environmental portrait. Super composition and perspective, even better processing to get it so realistic but with a hint of the medium in which she works. Great stuff. I''ll be back to hopefully learn something.</td>', 'Great photo. Excellent environmental portrait. Super composition and perspective, even better processing to get it so realistic but with a hint of the medium in which she works. Great stuff. I''ll be back to hopefully learn something.', '2011-03-07 10:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
