(6343991, 936177, 63218, '<td valign="top">Very good! This is just exactly how I feel, standing under a cherry tree in bloom, looking up at all that heedless beauty.  I can almost feel the breeze &amp; hear the robins. The softness in the air is like the pink cloud I always imagine I am in, under a cherry tree. Please accept my humble admiration &amp; this Gilded Lily for a great shot.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=831779" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831779.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831779.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831779.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-03-08 08:47:54.</i></td>', 'Very good! This is just exactly how I feel, standing under a cherry tree in bloom, looking up at all that heedless beauty.  I can almost feel the breeze & hear the robins. The softness in the air is like the pink cloud I always imagine I am in, under a cherry tree. Please accept my humble admiration & this Gilded Lily for a great shot.', '2011-03-07 11:12:02.000000', '2011-03-08 08:47:54.000000', 1),
