(6345020, 938313, 96751, '<td valign="top">As <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=108069" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bohemka</a> noted, back with a bang.  The amount of time and though you put into your images is so amply evident in the phenomenal results you achieve.  Bravo, Christophe.  You are truly my hero.  Welcome back.</td>', 'As  bohemka noted, back with a bang.  The amount of time and though you put into your images is so amply evident in the phenomenal results you achieve.  Bravo, Christophe.  You are truly my hero.  Welcome back.', '2011-03-08 00:12:58.000000', NULL, 0),
