(6345024, 938597, 63218, '<td valign="top">Interesting score for this. I was one of your 10s. I would never have guessed this was yours. Or that it was a gerbera. Love the abstract nature of this &amp; the minimal detail &amp; the lush color.  I wanted to give you a Gilded Lily before the challenge ended, I ran out of time. So, here it is now, a Gilded Lily &amp; my humble admiration for a lovely floral.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=831779" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831779.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831779.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831779.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Interesting score for this. I was one of your 10s. I would never have guessed this was yours. Or that it was a gerbera. Love the abstract nature of this & the minimal detail & the lush color.  I wanted to give you a Gilded Lily before the challenge ended, I ran out of time. So, here it is now, a Gilded Lily & my humble admiration for a lovely floral.', '2011-03-08 00:16:30.000000', NULL, 0),
