(6345142, 938490, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nice Tome. I would have looked at trying to get the top ridgeline to exit at the very top right corner instead of just shy of it, or alternately placing the river exit at the bottom more to one side or the other. I also might have boosted the whites a little bit on it, but this is still very nice. I may be a bit spoiled and critical though, because I just went and saw the Ansel Adams Masterworks exhibit which is currently here in town :)</td>', 'Very nice Tome. I would have looked at trying to get the top ridgeline to exit at the very top right corner instead of just shy of it, or alternately placing the river exit at the bottom more to one side or the other. I also might have boosted the whites a little bit on it, but this is still very nice. I may be a bit spoiled and critical though, because I just went and saw the Ansel Adams Masterworks exhibit which is currently here in town :)', '2011-03-08 01:15:50.000000', NULL, 0),
