(6345300, 937450, 11769, '<td valign="top">Nature has a way to produce such wonderful abstraction. And you captured and controlled that chaos perfectly. The lighter element at top with the darkest line running through it meandering downward. Everything feels like it is dripping from the top, like ink or paint, gravity having it''s way. <br/>Very creative work.</td>', 'Nature has a way to produce such wonderful abstraction. And you captured and controlled that chaos perfectly. The lighter element at top with the darkest line running through it meandering downward. Everything feels like it is dripping from the top, like ink or paint, gravity having it''s way. Very creative work.', '2011-03-08 07:51:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6345301, 938183, 60698, '<td valign="top">So glad this achieved the blue! Pure joy! What a fabulous moment captured!</td>', 'So glad this achieved the blue! Pure joy! What a fabulous moment captured!', '2011-03-08 07:51:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6345302, 937879, 43463, '<td valign="top">Top 10% - congrats on the great finish. Loved the details on this owl. The stare just draws you in.</td>', 'Top 10% - congrats on the great finish. Loved the details on this owl. The stare just draws you in.', '2011-03-08 07:52:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6345304, 938517, 43463, '<td valign="top">Hey, Tammy congrats on the good finish - Loved the processing - the color tones reminded me of the color tones of the chalk. For me it was always the intense look on the artist face and poise as she works that drew me in.</td>', 'Hey, Tammy congrats on the good finish - Loved the processing - the color tones reminded me of the color tones of the chalk. For me it was always the intense look on the artist face and poise as she works that drew me in.', '2011-03-08 07:54:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6345309, 938183, 72670, '<td valign="top">I always wonder how one gets these images so sharp. I never seem to be able to capture a moving object correctly. You have mastered it here. Congrats on the blue!</td>', 'I always wonder how one gets these images so sharp. I never seem to be able to capture a moving object correctly. You have mastered it here. Congrats on the blue!', '2011-03-08 07:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6345310, 938308, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the composition. For me the thing that makes this shot so compelling is the unique tree off to the side of the road. It is almost standing there like a guardian as I walk on the path that leads off to the horizon and onto another journey.....in fact reminds me a little of the Hobbit - "You step onto the road, and if you don''t keep your feet, there''s no knowing where you might be swept off to."</td>', 'Love the colors and the composition. For me the thing that makes this shot so compelling is the unique tree off to the side of the road. It is almost standing there like a guardian as I walk on the path that leads off to the horizon and onto another journey.....in fact reminds me a little of the Hobbit - "You step onto the road, and if you don''t keep your feet, there''s no knowing where you might be swept off to."', '2011-03-08 08:00:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6345311, 938183, 18505, '<td valign="top">Pure joy indeed... These puppies are having a wonderful time!!  Congratulations on your well-deserved blue!!</td>', 'Pure joy indeed... These puppies are having a wonderful time!!  Congratulations on your well-deserved blue!!', '2011-03-08 08:02:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6345314, 937452, 117474, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed this got under six. don''t let that get you down though. excellent capture. fantastic expression captured. love the use of negative space. love your title. love the lightin. the shot screams of music to me, which is incredible as there is no musical instrument in here. <br/>love the portrait. got a 7 from me... which should have been 8 in revision. sorry :-)</td>', 'I''m amazed this got under six. don''t let that get you down though. excellent capture. fantastic expression captured. love the use of negative space. love your title. love the lightin. the shot screams of music to me, which is incredible as there is no musical instrument in here. love the portrait. got a 7 from me... which should have been 8 in revision. sorry :-)', '2011-03-08 08:07:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6345317, 937816, 122678, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS... natural lighting is so beautiful and you got it just right!!! Good job!!! Congratulations to you many times over!!!</td>', 'GORGEOUS... natural lighting is so beautiful and you got it just right!!! Good job!!! Congratulations to you many times over!!!', '2011-03-08 08:10:03.000000', NULL, 0),
