(6346903, 938545, 69008, '<td valign="top">Oh cool, you spotted a rare "Florida Cowstrich".  They are camera shy, so they bury their heads in the sand when they see a photographer nearby.<br/>You can  tell when you have found the "real deal" because they always moo backwards.</td>', 'Oh cool, you spotted a rare "Florida Cowstrich".  They are camera shy, so they bury their heads in the sand when they see a photographer nearby.You can  tell when you have found the "real deal" because they always moo backwards.', '2011-03-09 12:47:17.000000', NULL, 0),
