(6347016, 938326, 91783, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by keenon:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh my god, Roz - this is incredible! Congrats on 4th in FS - that''s huge! And well deserved, I might say. Crazy good capture! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I couldn''t say it any better my self :) congrats roz!!! very very very well deserved.</td>', 'Originally posted by keenon: Oh my god, Roz - this is incredible! Congrats on 4th in FS - that''s huge! And well deserved, I might say. Crazy good capture!   I couldn''t say it any better my self :) congrats roz!!! very very very well deserved.', '2011-03-09 14:01:52.000000', NULL, 0),
