(6347447, 937819, 115676, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.', '2011-03-09 22:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6347478, 937816, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sublime, and the light is wonderful.  Congrats on obtaining the elusive FS ribbon!  I will add that as lovely as this is, it is just a tad depressing, when one realizes that only 2% or so of the women in the world are this beautiful.  The rest of us live in shadow, never to know the beauty of light like this.  But then photographs of ugly women rarely strike anyone''s fancy.  :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-03-09 23:03:00.</i></td>', 'Sublime, and the light is wonderful.  Congrats on obtaining the elusive FS ribbon!  I will add that as lovely as this is, it is just a tad depressing, when one realizes that only 2% or so of the women in the world are this beautiful.  The rest of us live in shadow, never to know the beauty of light like this.  But then photographs of ugly women rarely strike anyone''s fancy.  :-)', '2011-03-09 23:00:57.000000', '2011-03-09 23:03:00.000000', 0),
(6347537, 938313, 98022, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic! I am always amazed at the creativity and effort that you put into your images. Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'This is fantastic! I am always amazed at the creativity and effort that you put into your images. Congrats on the HM!', '2011-03-10 00:29:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6347550, 938601, 127250, '<td valign="top">Very well done sir,<br/></td>', 'Very well done sir,', '2011-03-10 00:43:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6347608, 938232, 73942, '<td valign="top">great in flight capture</td>', 'great in flight capture', '2011-03-10 05:29:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6347642, 937816, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Sublime, and the light is wonderful.  Congrats on obtaining the elusive FS ribbon!  I will add that as lovely as this is, it is just a tad depressing, when one realizes that only 2% or so of the women in the world are this beautiful.  The rest of us live in shadow, never to know the beauty of light like this.  But then photographs of ugly women rarely strike anyone''s fancy.  :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the thought provoking comment and I hear you. I think the whole thing is self-fulfilling; I''d love to take pictures of a much more representative sample of people, but not too many make themselves available for such work....<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: Sublime, and the light is wonderful.  Congrats on obtaining the elusive FS ribbon!  I will add that as lovely as this is, it is just a tad depressing, when one realizes that only 2% or so of the women in the world are this beautiful.  The rest of us live in shadow, never to know the beauty of light like this.  But then photographs of ugly women rarely strike anyone''s fancy.  :-)   Thanks for the thought provoking comment and I hear you. I think the whole thing is self-fulfilling; I''d love to take pictures of a much more representative sample of people, but not too many make themselves available for such work.... ', '2011-03-10 07:35:11.000000', NULL, 0),
