(6349321, 938183, 59029, '<td valign="top">Great capture, very well-deserved blue!  And the tongues on those dogs are insane, and the dog on the right does look possessed!  Personally I like the sepia toned husky :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-03-12 06:27:43.</i></td>', 'Great capture, very well-deserved blue!  And the tongues on those dogs are insane, and the dog on the right does look possessed!  Personally I like the sepia toned husky :-)', '2011-03-12 06:24:56.000000', '2011-03-12 06:27:43.000000', 0),
