(6349706, 937971, 74979, '<td valign="top">beautiful!!  nice capture and great finish!!<br/> <br/>WooHoo Cordi!!<br/> <br/>XOXOXO Esmi</td>', 'beautiful!!  nice capture and great finish!! WooHoo Cordi!! XOXOXO Esmi', '2011-03-12 20:23:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6350992, 937339, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a strong finish in a free study. Top 10 is a big achievement and your hard work is paying off. The true reward is in beautiful pictures like this</td>', 'Congrats on a strong finish in a free study. Top 10 is a big achievement and your hard work is paying off. The true reward is in beautiful pictures like this', '2011-03-14 15:31:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6352657, 938216, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m sorta amazed this scored as high as it did. I don''t mean that pejoratively, though it comes off that way. It just doesn''t strike me as something that would score decently in a FS, is all- a neutral statement. <br/> <br/>I very much like this. It''s got a very nice degree of detail mixed in with the movement. The sculpting of the red, in particular, is really pretty awesome, making it seemingly three dimensional. Very cool.</td>', 'I''m sorta amazed this scored as high as it did. I don''t mean that pejoratively, though it comes off that way. It just doesn''t strike me as something that would score decently in a FS, is all- a neutral statement.  I very much like this. It''s got a very nice degree of detail mixed in with the movement. The sculpting of the red, in particular, is really pretty awesome, making it seemingly three dimensional. Very cool.', '2011-03-16 01:11:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353345, 938183, 118396, '<td valign="top">Every time I log onto DPC now, my daughter wants to look at this picture - she LOVES dogs!  Thanks for giving her something to enjoy!  Well deserved blue ribbon.</td>', 'Every time I log onto DPC now, my daughter wants to look at this picture - she LOVES dogs!  Thanks for giving her something to enjoy!  Well deserved blue ribbon.', '2011-03-16 13:43:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353856, 937597, 76335, '<td valign="top">Ha! <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a> should have looked more closely. I didn''t get to spend as much time with this Free Study as I would have liked, and so subtler things were lost on me. I recognized this as a well composed black and white study in urban forms and scored it accordingly. But, dammit, I missed the building. <br/> <br/>In any case, that''s not the first time I shot the Pittsburgh sibling. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=673170" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/854/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_673170.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/854/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_673170.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/854/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_673170.jpg"/></a><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=807020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76335/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_807020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76335/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_807020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76335/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_807020.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Ha!  bvy should have looked more closely. I didn''t get to spend as much time with this Free Study as I would have liked, and so subtler things were lost on me. I recognized this as a well composed black and white study in urban forms and scored it accordingly. But, dammit, I missed the building.  In any case, that''s not the first time I shot the Pittsburgh sibling. ', '2011-03-16 21:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
